concept concept {
  name = "Concept"
  summary = "A unit that captures an idea or mental model of something."
  audience = :both
  related = [{ id: "process", why: "Process supports Concept: A unit (authored as a procedure) that captures the reliable sequence for doing a task — ordered steps, for someone who already knows the topic." }]
  body {
    p <<DOC
      A concept is a unit of knowledge that describes an idea of something. This is usually an idea,
      a mental modal.
    DOC

    p "Some examples of a concept are: A mental modal, mathimatical process or a software pattern.\n"
  }
}
